<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: A prisoner of the colony will be locked in a cage, and set fire, killing the prisoner in the process. Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.description>Um prisioneiro da colônia é trancado numa jaula e incendiado, morrendo no processo. Conforme a qualidade do ritual, os participantes recebem entre {MINMOOD} e {MAXMOOD} de humor por {MOODDAYS} dias.</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.description>
  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.comps.0.label>número de participantes</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.comps.1.label>impacto social de {PAWN_labelShort}</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!-- EN: speaker's social impact -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.comps.1.labelAbstract>impacto social do orador</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.comps.1.labelAbstract>
  <!-- EN: Terrible -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>Terrível</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was terrible! The prisoner rattled the cage all the time and it smelled like rotten bacon. -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>O(a) {0} foi terrível! O prisioneiro sacudiu a jaula o tempo todo, e cheirava a bacon estragado.</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Lackluster -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>Confuso</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was lackluster. The prisoner just burned to death too fast, and the fire didn't even lift our spirits much. -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>O(a) {0} foi sem graça. O prisioneiro morreu queimado rápido demais, e o fogo nem animou muito a gente.</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!-- EN: Good -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>Boa</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was good. The anguished cries of the prisoner will resonate with us for a long time, another soul consumed by the flames. -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>O(a) {0} foi bom(boa). Os gritos de agonia do prisioneiro vão ecoar em nós por muito tempo, mais uma alma consumida pelas chamas.</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!-- EN: Glorious -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>Gloriosa</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was glorious! We will forever remember the thrashing of the prisoner, the frightened crescendo of screams as another soul was consumed by the holy flames. -->
  <VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>O(a) {0} foi glorioso(a)! Lembraremos para sempre do prisioneiro se debatendo, do crescendo assustado dos gritos enquanto mais uma alma era consumida pelas chamas sagradas.</VME_WickerManBurningOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
</LanguageData>
